1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,450
Now read the water potentials along the way.

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:06,992
Soil, minus zero point zero one five.

3
00:00:06,992 --> 00:00:10,000
Root xylem, minus zero point six.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,330
Trunk, minus one point two.

5
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:13,632
Leaf, minus two.

6
00:00:13,632 --> 00:00:18,932
And dry air outside, at fifty percent humidity, about minus ninety-three.

7
00:00:18,932 --> 00:00:25,117
Water slides down this slope the whole way, and the giant step into the air does the pulling.

